  <p id="c-nanshi-046-wangjiong-anmin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">城局參軍<persName id="c-nanshi-046-wangjiong-anmin:p001:m0004" ref="0ra_fe7_j4d">王回</persName>素爲<persName id="c-nanshi-046-wangjiong-anmin:p001:m0008" ref="4xf_x1f_vsg">安人</persName>所親，盜絹二匹。<persName id="c-nanshi-046-wangjiong-anmin:p001:m0018" ref="4xf_x1f_vsg">安人</persName>流涕謂曰：「我與卿契闊備嘗，今日犯王法，乃卿負我也。」於軍門斬之，厚爲斂祭，軍府皆震服。</p>
</text>
